# Built APKs. A `preview` APK is ~100MB and is fetched from its EAS artifact URL
# (`eas build:view <id> --json` -> artifacts.buildUrl), never rebuilt from the
# repository, so committing one bloats every clone and never makes a build faster.
artifacts/
